 Any other field is ignored, and the validator forwards only the fields the frame defines. In particular the server does not read a `chatId` from this message: the connection already determines the session ([validated by: drops any field the frame does not define, rather than forwarding it](../../src/transport/ws/validation.test.ts#L18)).
 
+A `list_sessions` frame may carry an integer `limit` of zero or more and a `before` cursor object with a 1–128 character `sessionId` and an `updatedAt` date string or number; any other `limit` or `before` is `INVALID_MESSAGE` ([validated by: accepts a bare list_sessions frame and rejects a malformed limit or before with INVALID_MESSAGE without calling listFor](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L163); [validated by: rejects a malformed limit or before](../../src/transport/ws/validation.test.ts#L39)).
+
